{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41339","headline":"和蜀後主题劒门 · 王仁裕","name":"和蜀後主题劒门","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"孟阳曾有语，刊在白云棱。\n李杜常挨托，孙刘亦恃凭。\n庸才安可守，上德始堪矜。\n暗指长天路，浓峦蔽几层。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王仁裕","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41339.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41339","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}